    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108541" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκεν-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>empty below, purge,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κοιλίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prog.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκεκενωμένος</span>”
				<i>purged,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					2.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>carry off by purging,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κόπρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Int.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			).</div>
